Begin with [Philosophy](philosophy/Philosophy.lingua), including Ancient Greek philosophy, Buddhism, and Yoga. History, sociology, political-economy, literature, and art are neighbouring areas to develop. Their planned scopes are linked in the register; existing Records remain reusable across these areas.

[Trail authoring](../lince/Trails.lingua#r_7A4AY51TXG87NVHR9J1XNZTJQ9).

**Scope:** Philosophy, its traditions, history, sociology, political-economy, literature, and art belong here. Studying work, power, and distribution connects to Ergon without reducing social inquiry to production. Use [Philosophy](philosophy/Philosophy.lingua) as an existing entrance; retain the art directory alongside it.

